Third-party components and data
===============================

The MIT license covers the original code, configs, experiment scripts and
documents in this repository.

Not vendored (installed separately, never redistributed here):
- Docling (MIT) - default table/layout backend.
- MinerU (OpenDataLab) - optional `mineru` extra, licensed AGPL-3.0. This
  repository contains only a wrapper (src/doc_extraction/backends/
  mineru_backend.py) that calls an installed MinerU. Distributing a build,
  container or service that bundles or modifies MinerU would bring its
  AGPL-3.0 obligations into that distribution; this repository does not do so.
- OmniDocBench and other benchmark datasets: only manifests and derived
  reports are tracked; ground-truth JSON is excluded. Their terms are not
  asserted here.

Data in this repository:
- research/hardcases/corpus/*.pdf are synthetic (manifest: "synthetic": true,
  "contains_real_enterprise_data": false), generated by research/hardcases/generate.py.
- Kleister manifests reference datasets whose licences are NOT VERIFIED; no
  Kleister data is tracked.
